## 3. TEAM TYPES & FEE MODEL

| Type | Members | Fee |
|---|---|---|
| Individual | 1 | ₹300 |
| Duo | 2 | ₹600 |
| Square | 4 | ₹1,200 |

Fee = `memberCount × ₹300`, always. The frontend may compute this for display, but **it is never trusted**: the backend independently recalculates `memberCount` from `teamType` and `totalAmount` from `memberCount × feePerParticipant` on every write. Reject any request where the client-sent amount or member count disagrees with the server's calculation.

Member 1 is always the **Team Leader** — same fields as everyone else, no separate/reduced form. Every member (all team sizes) provides: Full Name, Email, Phone (Indian 10-digit), College/Institution, Department, Year of Study, Register/Roll Number.

