## 10. UX DETAIL

Loading skeletons for homepage dynamic sections, submission, payment, upload, status lookup, admin tables. Empty states ("No registrations found.", "No pending payments."). Toasts for save/submit/verify/reject events — no spam. Dedicated 404/500/network-error/Firebase-error/upload-error components with generic user-facing copy.

