Performance: `next/image`, font subsetting, code-splitting, lazy-load below-the-fold sections, minimize client components, memoized Firestore queries.

SEO: title/description per the brand copy, Open Graph + Twitter cards, favicon, robots.txt, sitemap — never leak participant PII into metadata or SSR-rendered admin routes.

